<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>奇治法 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A5%87%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 10:13:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E5%A5%87%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>奇治法：论单味治病</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-28-jizhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 10:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-28-jizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“奇治法”部分（与前文奇病治法不同），专论&lt;strong&gt;单味药治病的独特法则&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;奇治者，可以一味而成功，不必更借重二味也。药专力宏，直捣病所，若杂以他药，反牵制其效&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>奇治法：论治奇症四十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-26-qizhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 09:36:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-26-qizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节出自《石室秘录》奇治法，专论&lt;strong&gt;奇病怪症&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则。核心思想为：&lt;strong&gt;奇病多由邪祟凭依、痰毒结聚、虫兽为患、情志郁极、房劳伤损等非常之因所致，不可以常法施治，当以奇方奇药应对，或内服、或外敷、或手术、或情志疗法，灵活变通，出奇制胜。&lt;/strong&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>